WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:21.534
Bird needed a plan to save her party.

2
00:00:21.535 --> 00:00:26.477
She flew back to the pond.

3
00:00:26.478 --> 00:00:36.745
Meanwhile Kip mixed cupcake batter.

4
00:00:36.746 --> 00:00:44.779
He poured it into a pan.

5
00:00:44.780 --> 00:00:48.563
He put the pan in the oven.

6
00:00:48.564 --> 00:01:04.003
"Okay," said Kip. "Now I need party games."

7
00:01:04.004 --> 00:01:10.974
Kip looked all over.

8
00:01:10.975 --> 00:01:13.837
But he couldn't find any party games.

9
00:01:13.838 --> 00:01:17.383
"Hmm," said Kip.

10
00:01:17.384 --> 00:01:21.382
"I also need decorations."

11
00:01:21.383 --> 00:01:31.571
Kip looked all over.

12
00:01:31.572 --> 00:01:35.806
But he couldn't find any decorations.

13
00:01:35.807 --> 00:01:40.709
Just then he smelled something.

14
00:01:40.710 --> 00:01:55.197
It smelled like . . .

15
00:01:55.198 --> 00:01:59.533
"Burnt cupcakes!"

16
00:01:59.534 --> 00:02:03.448
"Oh well," said Kip.

17
00:02:03.449 --> 00:02:06.896
"My party will still be fun.

18
00:02:06.897 --> 00:02:16.891
At least my friends will be there."

19
00:02:16.892 --> 00:02:24.741
Kip went to the giant rock.

20
00:02:24.742 --> 00:02:28.700
But nobody was there.

21
00:02:28.701 --> 00:02:31.569
"Oh no!" cried Kip.

22
00:02:31.570 --> 00:02:36.434
"I forgot to invite everyone!"

23
00:02:36.435 --> 00:02:41.854
"My party has no cupcakes," said Kip.

24
00:02:41.855 --> 00:02:48.262
"It has no party games. It has no decorations.

25
00:02:48.263 --> 00:02:54.558
And it has no friends!"
